				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "36690bfa-9696-5abd-88ec-c78ac5cfdf2a")
	)
	(text "S2: DRIVER AND 2 GATES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 306.057 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "58de0545-b83c-5c53-b651-444ee12db5cd")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 4.02k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 89.052 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7dddfccd-0cd2-51c9-bd44-72462f1c6b11")
	)
	(text "S2: LOGIC SIDE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "830a4c1d-c6c0-5b60-9bcf-b442218c7efe")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 3 x US1M - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.522 211.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8a87ab46-3751-50d7-b8a1-ad76492e0c0f")
	)
	(text "S2: DESAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.522 153.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b31d2d8a-7b8d-5f1a-ad1a-27549745b492")
	)
	(text "MMBT3906 inverter (E COM, base BAT54+2.2k on CLAMP) drives CG to COM once the lowest gate is below ~-1.2 V;\nMMBT3904 release (from OUTH via 5.6 V Zener) holds CG at VEE while OUTH drives."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 241.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bc103c77-9100-5ffc-a4f9-b4346aed7e9e")
	)
	(text "S2: SHORT-CIRCUIT BOOSTER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 153.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c4f82341-c2ca-5808-b6bf-4ae4cf814505")
	)
	(text "SYMMETRY: gate and Kelvin of S2a/S2b as coupled pairs of equal length (+/-10 %) from the COM_S2 star; Ron,\nRoff, Kelvin R, 10k, Zeners at each device; power sources joined only by the busbar. CLAMP LOOP: each\nAO3400A + C_VL at its device's gate-Kelvin pins, loop <= 1 nH. IC-22: milled slot between the drain\npin 1 and pins 2-4 of each TO-247-4L; DESAT string >= 2.5 mm pad gap per diode; board coated to PD1.\nMiller hold (gdrv rev 5, ngspice 1100 V / 72.4 A, 115 V/ns): die +1.41 V vs VGS(th) min 1.94 V at 175 C,\nmargin 0.53 V (rev 4 PNP: +2.14 V) - BENCH TEST (double pulse, hot, minimum-threshold devices)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 341.522 179.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f7458d07-68fc-5da3-8684-d5c3302e17e6")
	)
